    "title": "3D Reference Organ for Kidney, Female, Right",
    "description": "This reference organ, Right-kidney-female (https://humanatlas.io/3d-reference-library) was created using data from the\nVisible Human Dataset, provided by the National Library of Medicine (Spitzer and Whitlock 2002). In version v1.3,\nchanges include removing the renal calyces and renal papillae and adding them to the ureter model per subject matter\nexpert input.\n\n**Bibliography:**\n\n* Spitzer, Victor M., and David G. Whitlock. 2002. “The Visible Human Dataset: The Anatomical Platform for Human Simulation.” *The Anatomical Record* 253 (2): 49–57. https://doi.org/10.1002/(SICI)1097-0185(199804)253:2<49::AID-AR8>3.0.CO;2-9.",
